{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01MMZVXRwR8VZoSQfhBzdEnN", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sumak_kawsay\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.clubmitsubishiasx.com/faq/que-es-la-suma-lupina\"}, {\"url\": \"https://revistas.unisimon.edu.co/index.php/justicia/article/download/2882/3737/5010\"}, {\"url\": \"https://rosario.gob.ar/mr/epidemiologia/publicaciones-sime/ii-foro-latinoamericano-de-desarrollo-sostenible/presentaciones/sumak-kawsay\"}, {\"url\": \"https://revistas.ut.edu.co/index.php/Ideales/article/download/3991/3220/12071\"}, {\"url\": \"https://derechoecuador.com/el-buen-vivir-breves-reflexiones-constitucionales/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://base.socioeco.org/docs/eje2_sebastianendara.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://derechoecuador.com/?p=18142\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.clubmitsubishiasx.com/faq/como-se-dice-vida-armoniosa-en-aymara\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:34:17.803Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Sumak kawsay wikipedia \"equilibrio\" razón sentimiento ideal", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_017DseaWMzedKsRki2nzry43", "content": [{"title": "Sumak kawsay", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sumak_kawsay"}, {"title": "¿Qué es la suma Lupiña?", "url": "https://www.clubmitsubishiasx.com/faq/que-es-la-suma-lupina"}, {"title": "revistas.unisimon.edu.co", "url": "https://revistas.unisimon.edu.co/index.php/justicia/article/download/2882/3737/5010"}, {"title": "sumak kawsay", "url": "https://rosario.gob.ar/mr/epidemiologia/publicaciones-sime/ii-foro-latinoamericano-de-desarrollo-sostenible/presentaciones/sumak-kawsay"}, {"title": "revistas.ut.edu.co", "url": "https://revistas.ut.edu.co/index.php/Ideales/article/download/3991/3220/12071"}, {"title": "El Buen Vivir, Breves Reflexiones Constitucionales - Derecho Ecuador", "url": "https://derechoecuador.com/el-buen-vivir-breves-reflexiones-constitucionales/"}, {"title": "eje2 sebastianendara", "url": "https://base.socioeco.org/docs/eje2_sebastianendara.pdf"}, {"title": "El Buen Vivir, Breves Reflexiones Constitucionales - Derecho Ecuador", "url": "https://derechoecuador.com/?p=18142"}, {"title": "¿Cómo se dice vida armoniosa en aymara?", "url": "https://www.clubmitsubishiasx.com/faq/como-se-dice-vida-armoniosa-en-aymara"}]}, "The search didn't return a Spanish Wikipedia article, but the English Wikipedia entry and a few other sources touch on the ideal, balance, and the reason-feeling pairing.\n\n- **The ideal:** English Wikipedia describes sumak as referring to the ideal and beautiful fulfillment of the planet, while kawsay means \"life,\" a life with dignity, plenitude, balance, and harmony.\n- **Reason and feeling:** A Latin American sustainability forum presentation frames the Quechua idea of knowing as reflection that is not only rational but also comes from feeling, so one can walk the path of the heart without losing reason.\n- **Emotional balance:** A Derecho Ecuador essay says the collective, through work, pursues the emotional balance of the individual and of their relationships with the whole environment around them.\n- **Harmony with nature:** A Colombian journal article describes the concept as a comprehensive way of life in harmony with the community, nature, and the sacred.\n\nThe sources that explicitly link the ideal, balance, and reason-feeling are secondary and vary in rigor. The English Wikipedia entry is the most reliable of these; the Spanish Wikipedia page you asked about wasn't retrieved. I left out two results from clubmitsubishiasx.com because they look like low-quality content farms."], "durationSeconds": 6.132796000000002, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01MMZVXRwR8VZoSQfhBzdEnN", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
