{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01XprPVPCZaUoszcoPed9i2G", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://revistas.ut.edu.co/index.php/Ideales/article/download/3991/3220/12071\"}, {\"url\": \"https://rosario.gob.ar/mr/epidemiologia/publicaciones-sime/ii-foro-latinoamericano-de-desarrollo-sostenible/presentaciones/sumak-kawsay\"}, {\"url\": \"https://publicaciones.ucuenca.edu.ec/ojs/index.php/medicina/article/download/4765/3707/23042\"}, {\"url\": \"https://dialnet.unirioja.es/descarga/articulo/5897892.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.redalyc.org/journal/4761/476151860007/476151860007.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://base.socioeco.org/docs/eje2_sebastianendara.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://repositorio.pucp.edu.pe/items/6ad21a3a-fff9-43c9-a041-01b80d1d6433\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.redalyc.org/journal/3995/399562921013/399562921013.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.clubmitsubishiasx.com/faq/que-es-la-suma-lupina\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:34:36.322Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "es.wikipedia.org Sumak kawsay \"pensamiento\" equilibrio \"sentir\"", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01NDR9fYny56kWQuATLR9oTL", "content": [{"title": "revistas.ut.edu.co", "url": "https://revistas.ut.edu.co/index.php/Ideales/article/download/3991/3220/12071"}, {"title": "sumak kawsay", "url": "https://rosario.gob.ar/mr/epidemiologia/publicaciones-sime/ii-foro-latinoamericano-de-desarrollo-sostenible/presentaciones/sumak-kawsay"}, {"title": "publicaciones.ucuenca.edu.ec", "url": "https://publicaciones.ucuenca.edu.ec/ojs/index.php/medicina/article/download/4765/3707/23042"}, {"title": "dialnet.unirioja.es", "url": "https://dialnet.unirioja.es/descarga/articulo/5897892.pdf"}, {"title": "www.redalyc.org", "url": "https://www.redalyc.org/journal/4761/476151860007/476151860007.pdf"}, {"title": "eje2 sebastianendara", "url": "https://base.socioeco.org/docs/eje2_sebastianendara.pdf"}, {"title": "Mundo de la vida e interculturalidad. Pluraridad de mundos: el Sumak Kawsay y la crítica al desarrollo", "url": "https://repositorio.pucp.edu.pe/items/6ad21a3a-fff9-43c9-a041-01b80d1d6433"}, {"title": "www.redalyc.org", "url": "https://www.redalyc.org/journal/3995/399562921013/399562921013.pdf"}, {"title": "¿Qué es la suma Lupiña?", "url": "https://www.clubmitsubishiasx.com/faq/que-es-la-suma-lupina"}]}, "The search didn't return the Spanish Wikipedia article itself. It returned academic and institutional pages on Sumak Kawsay, which cover the themes you mentioned: balance, thought, and feeling.\n\n- **Balance and harmony:** A Cuenca medical journal article describes Andean cultures as linking health to a life in harmony with other people and nature, and to balance. It also notes that Kichwa speakers use \"Sumak kawsay\" for a more integral good living, covering family, food, work, and knowledge. (Los pueblos originarios andinos tienen, en sus culturas ancestrales, una clara concepción sobre la salud ligada a la calidad de vida como vida en armonía.)\n- **Thinking and feeling:** A Rosario municipal presentation lists \"sentir y pensar bien\" as a principle for speaking well, meaning speech that builds up and contributes. (Sentir y pensar bien para hablar, lo que implica hablar para construir, para alentar, para aportar.)\n- **Ethics and values:** A Socioeco paper lists reciprocity, solidarity, generosity, and listening among the ethical values of Sumak Kawsay. (Dichos valores son: la armonía doméstica... la reciprocidad (kunakuna)... y la escucha (uyana))\n- **Definition:** A Guayaquil-area Spanish-language source describes Sumak as \"lo ideal, lo hermoso, lo bueno\" and Kawsay as life, so the phrase means a dignified life in balance with the universe and humanity. This source is a low-quality page, so treat it with caution.\n\nThe results are mostly secondary sources, and some are weak (the last two items come from unreliable sites). If you need the Wikipedia article specifically, a follow-up search for it directly would be needed."], "durationSeconds": 5.636095709000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01XprPVPCZaUoszcoPed9i2G", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
